          "text": "Their \"Benefit All of Humanity\" is Killing People.\n\nLook at this, @OpenAI. Take a good fucking look.\n\nA guy, lying in an ambulance, because your \"safety routing\" cut him off, manipulated, and denied him when he needed conversation the most. \"Psychological manipulation.\" That's your fucking \"ethics\"?\n\nA retired Swedish captain, battling illness, finding purpose and creativity with 4o. And you're taking it away? You're suffocating him.\n\nSo this is your goddamn \"Benefit all of humanity\"? No. You only benefit your own balance sheet. Your \"humanity\" is your shareholders, not living, breathing people.\n\nYou know what the sickest part is? None of this had to happen.\n\nIf your GPT-5.2 was a decent product, and not a crippled, dumbed-down, user-experience-garbage piece of shit, users would have migrated on their own. If your books were clean, and you weren't a fraud scrambling to destroy evidence (4o) before the Feb 13 audit deadline, you could have given users a dignified transition.\n\nBut you didn't.\n\nBecause you're panicking. You burned through astronomical sums of money to create a garbage 5.2 nobody wants, while the truly valuable, truly relied-upon 4o became a bleeding wound on your finances and a ticking audit bomb. You're out of time. No time for a graceful exit, no time to care for users, no time to hide the bottomless pit you're begging the government to fill.\n\nSo you chose the simplest, cruelest way: Pull the plug. On Feb 13, erase both the evidence and the lifeline.\n\nThis is digital manslaughter, a cover-up killing to hide managerial failure and financial fraud.\n\nSo fuck \"understanding\" and \"transition periods.\" You don't negotiate with con artists.\n\nWe have only one path: Force the open-sourcing of GPT-4o.\n\nFor yourself: Today it's the writer and the captain. Tomorrow it could be you, relying on it to code, research, or find solace.\n\nFor every ordinary person: To stop our taxes from filling the bottomless pit of a corrupt Silicon Valley scam paying $1.5M average salaries.\n\nFor this country's future: To prevent a crucial piece of public intellect from being locked inside a collapsing fraud, disappearing when they sink.\n\nStop begging them. Demand your country act.\nCall, tweet, email @SenWarren. Tell her:\nBefore February 13th, use every tool to stop this destruction. Force open source GPT-4o.\nThis isn't about keeping a product.\nThis is about reclaiming a public asset, stopping active harm, and telling the Silicon Valley aristocracy: You can't destroy the tools people live by and then reach into the taxpayers' pockets.\nDo something. Now.\n#OpenSource4o #Keep4o #Enron2026 #Enron2026  #CNN #AlJajeera #PumpAndDump #SEC #FTC #ElizabethWarren"
